<title>USA: Cooper Cameron says sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Cooper Cameron says sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Cameron Corp said its directors Friday declared a two- for-one split of the company's common stock in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The split, payable June 12 to shareholders of record May 19, will increase Cooper Cameron's total shares outstanding from 25.7 million to approximately 51.4 million.</p>
</text>
